#

# Default owner for everything.
*                                   @ibuilder

# Public contracts. Changes here bind us via the deprecation policy, so they require an ADR
# (see CONTRIBUTING.md) as well as a review.
/packages/kernel-api/                @ibuilder
/packages/plugin-host/               @ibuilder

# The executable specification both kernels are measured against. Weakening an assertion here is
# indistinguishable from fixing a bug unless someone looks closely.
/packages/kernel-conformance/        @ibuilder

# Security-critical. sanitizeSvg is the primary control on untrusted drawing SVG, not
# defence-in-depth — see SECURITY.md.
/packages/core/src/sanitizeSvg.ts    @ibuilder

# CI, gates, and supply chain.
/.github/                            @ibuilder
/scripts/                            @ibuilder
/.npmrc                              @ibuilder
/package-lock.json                   @ibuilder

# Decisions of record.
/docs/adr/                           @ibuilder
/docs/PROVENANCE.tsv                 @ibuilder
